**Kitchen appliance (1)** comprising:

- a bowl (2) defining a processing chamber (3);
- a casing (4);
- a drive mechanism (5) enclosed within the casing (4) and configured to drive a processing tool (6) arranged in the bowl (2); and
- a lid (7) removably mountable on the bowl (2), the lid (7) comprising a central opening (8) for introducing fluid into the processing chamber (3),

**characterised in that** the lid (7) comprises a fluid-guiding portion (9) extending towards the central opening (8) and configured to collect fluid supplied to the lid (7) and guide said fluid through the central opening (8), the fluid-guiding portion (9) being shaped such that the fluid enters the processing chamber (3) in a controlled flow while substantially preventing splashing through or around the central opening (8).
